ts=2026-11-08T12:38:28.391Z type=context scope=lachslauncher content="LachsLauncher: Rust Minecraft launcher (Tauri GUI + CLI) at /home/lachs/Projekte/LachsLauncher, repo https://github.com/maxderlachslachs-commits/LachsLauncher. Supports vanilla 1.18.2+ and Fabric/Forge/NeoForge/Quilt; imports existing CurseForge instances; Discord RPC/webhook; Deckboard HTTP API (port 17321); MCP server; OpenCode skill minecraft-launcher. Verified launching Fabric (Waylandcraft 26.1.2) and Forge (Horizont 3 1.20.1)." tags=minecraft,launcher,rust
